{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_024_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9e06629a5522749714f7b1ddfc9d9a5a60798b1f44dbfd31fe3ae997681f918c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_024_22:5_01_024_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69f895a0f82369e5e0e4cb3e50e73c8d6df7540ab14b7cc517720e507859ae19",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱， 这个难道就是情人节巧克力吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_024_22:5_01_024_22_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:389718ebba808b1feffc5aac2aeb85e4e1a06de1b433a71183807f9205ff07a1",
      "text": "唔哦哦！真是Mega Thank You！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_024_22:5_01_024_22_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:239d72c2584cc825b652e1b9e8cad6983b55bf294f635ab789675cf2b1ec0d24",
      "text": "咕～看起来超级好吃！ 吃了这个，接下来的工作我也会加油的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_024_22:5_01_024_22_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4ac0a343024f3071f2ee82856773bd5d36a628ae7cca9e6f394f6cbb063fac1",
      "text": "嘿嘿，●●●●プロデューサー酱真是 激发我干劲的天才呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_024_22:5_01_024_22_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb5221b061377ded05b3d570e96486a8e95c1f3622239a3c8d471c67548ad2c3",
      "text": "白色情人节的回礼，还请好好期待哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_024_22:5_01_024_22_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa57269ec1013801ad8abb2eb0961b411ef35887f9d91a94c851c6c39c9da4c2",
      "text": "这、这莫非就是……情人节巧克力吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_024_22:5_01_024_22_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dbac1c38c844ca1c8648a741ffbd810c6e4093a8a1a483b9c18a746ff9e11e0",
      "text": "咕～情绪Hyper高涨起来啦～！ 太谢谢你了，●●●●プロデューサー酱☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_024_22:5_01_024_22_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74ed0c3fe5ceacc728a1968cf05a9b8dd1181bdcc4554a4f14fb3c0f98b056b0",
      "text": "我这就开吃咯。我开动啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_024_22:5_01_024_22_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff687e8bd7683c571f6af5ee96673043f6e485b188d1f38e2ed8455c7dedd59e",
      "text": "嗯～超级无敌好吃！ 太棒啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_024_22:5_01_024_22_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be2fe431e849cd76b6e39afc83cfca10c7d4e6923ba071b0ee80081edad1df86",
      "text": "居然为我准备了这么好吃的巧克力， 真是感激涕零送糖糖啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_024_22:5_01_024_22_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5153c9ded26690205969f844371e21222c091faa8fb93325489b8b572932b00b",
      "text": "好嘞！好吃的巧克力也吃过了， 今天的工作干劲100%……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_024_22:5_01_024_22_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbd7311d47f179ba3465ebb6486a2ccd477f7bd035303c9a22e1d285d7f7b659",
      "text": "不对，是要拿出315%的干劲， 把情绪嗨到最高点哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_024_22:5_01_024_22_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d5a3ce0c5ed348de8af1a65c8fa7d3c2ed3fdfd8db7e02c2ed6035f5031aa72",
      "text": "我的活跃表现，你可千万不能错过哦， ●●●●プロデューサー酱！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_024_22:5_01_024_22_b:cmd-000064:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04389d472d048a3f991d062616c27ad26472bae153ea6da19e41ff2bd2dd431d",
      "text": "当然！我会一直看着的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_024_22:5_01_024_22_b:cmd-000065:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ca3e9e06bf0a6879646ba774cdbfbb44a4e1d4f0c47dcf21bb46c673e60659d",
      "text": "我也会拿出315%的干劲加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_024_22:5_01_024_22_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86b7e19ebc6143f1c2f397a31052b93a8c54666ae9e6eb2221efd7fd16c77147",
      "text": "嘿嘿，我们一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
